      "repair_reason": "- [P2] Human review is needed for the plugin-visible fallback compatibility decision and the remaining real-behavior-proof gate; there is no narrow automated code repair to queue.; Cleared: No concrete security or supply-chain regression was found; the diff changes a shared response-reading helper and focused tests without new dependencies, workflows, secrets, or code execution paths. (sha=570736cc6494f888f56e5f36c76d3671cd5f3f38)",
      "review_summary": "The branch updates `readResponseText` to fail closed before whole-body `arrayBuffer()` or `text()` fallbacks when `maxBytes` is set, adds regression coverage, and converts web fetch tests to native streaming `Response` fixtures.\n\nPR surface: Source +10, Tests +17. Total +27 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current `main` and `v2026.6.11` can fall through to whole-body `arrayBuffer()` or `text()` reads when `maxBytes` is set but no readable stream is available.",
      "review_followup": "- [P2] Human review is needed for the plugin-visible fallback compatibility decision and the remaining real-behavior-proof gate; there is no narrow automated code repair to queue.",
